        "subject": "LU-20872 build: Honor o2ib configuration in packaging",
        "message": "LU-20872 build: Honor o2ib configuration in packaging\n\n1) configure: add the default fallback to the OFED search dir, and\n   clean up the external o2ib detection.\n\n2) rpm: use --with-o2ib from configure_args if given, otherwise\n   follow the mofed/o2ib bconds, instead of searching the OFED dir.\n\n3) deb: set the ext_o2ib/int_o2ib profiles from the o2iblnd\n   selection, as DPKG_* were never substituted, and use them\n   only if IB_OPTIONS is not given, as in rpm.\n\nFixes: ec03c9628cae (\"LU-15417 build: find the new path for MOFED 5.5\")\nFixes: 8b1d2a72f10e (\"LU-16967 build: Add in-kernel-ko2iblnd driver\")\nFixes: 95287378fabf (\"LU-16967 build: Separate lnet LND deb packaging\")\nTest-Parameters: trivial\nSigned-off-by: Xiao Yang <xyang@ddn.com>\nChange-Id: I5a77db50cf80fac4eb6dda6e73b29fd3e5eda252\n"
      },
      "branch": "refs/heads/master"
    }
